Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates hands-on design of a real-time RAG system, including multi-embedding chunking, multi-stage retrieval, and data freshness in production-like conditions.

Key Concepts
- Dual-embedding chunking
- Vector DB indexing and cosine search
- Cross-encoder reranking
- Streaming updates and TTL pruning
- Latency targets and observability

Code Example
```javascript
async function retrieve(query) {
  const eSent = await embed(query, 'sentence');
  const eSect = await embed(query, 'section');
  const topSent = vectorDB.search(eSent,  topK);
  const topSect = vectorDB.search(eSect, topK);
  // fuse and rerank
  return rerank(topSent, topSect, query);
}
```

